// A compiler built without the `rcgmp` feature rejects `Nat` and `Int`
// where a program names them, though `core` still declares both.

// UNSUPPORTED: rcgmp
// RUN: %not %rene build --manifest-path %S/core_bigint/rene.ncl --build-dir %t.bdir %rrc_linker 2>&1 | %FileCheck %s

// CHECK: `Nat` requires the `rcgmp` feature, which this compiler was built without
// CHECK: `Int` requires the `rcgmp` feature, which this compiler was built without
